{"speciesId":807,"names":{"fr":"Zeraora","es":"Zeraora","en":"Zeraora","ja":"ゼラオラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il déchiquette son adversaire avec ses griffes chargées d’électricité. Même si sa cible évite l’attaque, elle reçoit un coup de jus."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Hace jirones al oponente con sus garras electrificadas. Aunque este esquive los golpes, acaba electrocutado por las descargas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It electrifies its claws and tears its opponents apart with them. Even if they dodge its attack, they’ll be electrocuted by the flying sparks."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"両手足の ツメを 帯電させ 相手を 八つ裂き。 かわされても 飛び散る 電撃で 感電させる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il prend l’ennemi par surprise en attaquant plus vite que l’éclair, et le débite en morceaux avec ses griffes acérées."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se acerca a su enemigo de forma tan súbita como la caída de un rayo, y lo hace trizas con sus afiladas garras."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It approaches its enemies at the speed of lightning, then tears them limb from limb with its sharp claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"雷が 落ちるのと 同じ 速さで 敵に 急接近。 鋭い ツメで 八つ裂きに する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il fonce sur ses ennemis à la vitesse de l’éclair et les déchiquette à l’aide de ses griffes chargées à haute tension."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Tan veloz como el rayo, hace trizas a cualquier rival con sus garras cargadas de electricidad de alto voltaje."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It runs as fast as lightning strikes, shredding its opponents with its high-voltage claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"雷に 匹敵する スピードで 走り 大電圧を 発する ツメで 敵を 八つ裂きにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il envoie des décharges électriques avec les coussinets de ses pattes. Quand il court, on peut voir des éclairs et entendre la foudre."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las almohadillas de sus patas desprenden descargas eléctricas. Cuando corre, hace que caigan rayos y reverberen los truenos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Electricity sparks from the pads on its limbs. Wherever Zeraora runs, lightning flashes and thunder echoes."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"手足の 肉球から 放電。 ゼラオラが 駆け抜けると 稲妻が 光り 雷鳴が 轟く。"}],"varieties":[{"id":807,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[18,"level-up",29],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",48],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"agility","learns":[[20,"level-up",80],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"quick-attack","learns":[[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-swipes","learns":[[18,"level-up",12],[20,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slash","learns":[[18,"level-up",33],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reversal","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scary-face","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"outrage","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20